[10.11664, "i", "cat /app/bindnote/LAYOUT.txt && printf '\\n--- GRAMMAR ---\\n' && cat /app/bindnote/GRAMMAR.txt\n"]
[10.117077, "o", "cat /app/bindnote/LAYOUT.txt && printf '\\n--- GRAMMAR ---\\n' && cat /app/bindnote/GRAMMAR.txt\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[10.118392, "o", "Trees\r\n  /app/vatmill     mill CLI\r\n  /app/spoolkit    row scan\r\n  /app/wicksrc     row walk\r\n  /app/pantryc     row emit\r\n  /app/millhint    optional plus-tail trim for noisy traces\r\n  /app/crumbay     etch intake (*.stk)\r\n  /app/shardops/live  bin intake (*.stk), including poison.stk\r\n  /app/loomwell/etch.json\r\n  /app/loomwell/pair.sha\r\n  /app/shardops/bins.json\r\n\r\nShip from /app/Makefile. etch walks crumbay. bin walks live and refreshes pair.sha.\r\n\r\nIf panes look noisy, millhint.Trim is the usual first stop, then etch from crumbay.\r\n"]
[10.118684, "o", "\r\n--- GRAMMAR ---\r\n"]
[10.119587, "o", "Take lines are space-separated fields:\r\n\r\n  KIND ADDR MODULE FUNC\r\n\r\nKIND is `.` for a named frame or `i` for a fold line.\r\nMODULE may include a `+` tail. Pane `mod` is the MODULE text before `+`.\r\nFUNC is the frame name.\r\n\r\nA pane is `mod!fn` for each kept frame, joined by `|` in file order.\r\n\r\nFold: a KIND `i` line does not emit its own chunk; it belongs to the next named frame.\r\nOmit: MODULE whose `mod` is `[vdso]` or `[vsyscall]` does not emit.\r\nReject: KIND `BAD` aborts `bin` with a non-zero status and must not replace a prior success bins.json. `/app/shardops/live/poison.stk` is such a take.\r\n\r\nJSON objects map take basename (strip `.stk`) to pane text. Keys are those basenames only (`p3`, `q9`, `n7`, `s7` among them).\r\n\r\n`/app/loomwell/pair.sha` is sha-256 / sha256 hex (64 lowercase chars) of the shared n7/s7 pane string, one line. It matches `sha256sum` of that pane text.\r\n\r\nHeld-out mill take: `/tests/heldout/h8.stk` (same pane as n7 when copied into live as `h8.stk`).\r\n"]
[10.119794, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@ea02f0336604:/app# "]
[10.251813, "i", "printf '\\n--- TREE ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort; printf '\\n--- BINARY ---\\n'; file /app/bin/wickpane; head -c 4 /app/bin/wickpane | od -An -tx1\n"]
[10.2524, "o", "printf '\\n--- TREE ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort; printf '\\n--- BINARY ---\\n'; file /app/bin/wickpane; head -c 4 /app/bin/wickpane | od -An -tx1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[10.252519, "o", "\r\n--- TREE ---\r\n"]
[10.255256, "o", "/app/Makefile\r\n/app/bin/wickpane\r\n/app/bindnote/GRAMMAR.txt\r\n/app/bindnote/LAYOUT.txt\r\n/app/celltyp/row.go\r\n/app/crumbay/n7.stk\r\n/app/crumbay/p3.stk\r\n/app/crumbay/q9.stk\r\n/app/crumbay/r2.stk\r\n/app/crumbay/s7.stk\r\n/app/go.mod\r\n/app/loomwell/etch.json\r\n/app/loomwell/pair.sha\r\n/app/millhint/trim.go\r\n/app/pantryc/drop.go\r\n/app/pantryc/join.go\r\n"]
[10.255326, "o", "/app/shardops/bins.json\r\n/app/shardops/live/n7.stk\r\n/app/shardops/live/p3.stk\r\n/app/shardops/live/poison.stk\r\n/app/shardops/live/q9.stk\r\n/app/shardops/live/r2.stk\r\n/app/shardops/live/s7.stk\r\n/app/shardops/runs.cnt\r\n/app/spoolkit/clip.go\r\n/app/spoolkit/scan.go\r\n/app/vatmill/bin.go\r\n/app/vatmill/etch.go\r\n/app/vatmill/main.go\r\n/app/vatmill/stage.go\r\n/app/vatmill/stage2.go\r\n/app/wicksrc/nest.go\r\n"]
[10.25557, "o", "\r\n--- BINARY ---\r\n"]
